ity was generally good, with many appreciating the taste and variety, especially at breakfast. However, concerns about the limited menu and issues like oily dishes were noted by a minority. Some guests found the food affordable but mentioned a need for improvement in the breakfast spread\u0027s freshness and quality. Overall, the dining experience received mixed feedback, with a significant number of positive remarks."}},"feedbackData":{"title":"Was this helpful?","data":{"title":"Share Feedback","sections":[{"title":"We would like to know why you are unhappy with us :","items":[{"text":"Information provided is not very clear","type":"text"},{"text":"Details provided are excessive","type":"text"},{"text":"My reason is not listed here","type":"textBox","textBoxTitle":"Please state your reason here"}]}]}},"restaurants":[{"title":"Restaurant ","imageUrl":"https://gos3.ibcdn.com/73b5cee235b511ed9bd00a58a9feac02.jpg","categoryId":"restaurantAtTheProperty1"}],"isMealDetailsPresent":false},"groupBookingHotel":false,"calendarCriteria":{"available":true,"maxDate":"2026-12-07","advanceDays":90.0,"mlos":1.0},"specialFare":false,"goStay":false,"checkInTimeInRange":false,"checkOutTimeInRange":false,"isRTB":false,"isABSO":false,"isMLOS":true,"hotelCategories":"Mid_Low_DH_DTB|MyBiz Assured|budget_hotels|Inmarket|Flyer Deal","streetViewInfo":{"panoId":"n6oQD_O94kdtO6EORg5HKQ","title":"Street View","subTitle":"Explore area around the property","iconurl":"https://promos.makemytrip.com/Hotels_product/Streetview3.png","locationCardImageUrl":"https://go-assets.ibcdn.com/u/MMT/images/1764656029221-StreetViewDH_2.png","location":{"lat":19.127649307250977,"lng":72.8327407836914}},"streetViewDataAvailable":false,"chatbotInfo":{"chatBotUrl":"https://myra.makemytrip.com/chat-expert?lob\u003dHOTELS\u0026lobCategory\u003ddh\u0026project\u003dhotels_dh_chatbot\u0026page\u003dDETAIL\u0026hotelID\u003d201206031408087893\u0026hotelName\u003dSG90ZWwgQXJpYW5hIFJlc2lkZW5jeSwgTXVtYmFp\u0026checkin\u003